+
+```json
+curl -G http://localhost:9090/api/v1/metadata?limit_per_metric=1
+
+{
+  "status": "success",
+  "data": {
+    "cortex_ring_tokens": [
+      {
+        "type": "gauge",
+        "help": "Number of tokens in the ring",
+        "unit": ""
+      }
+    ],
+    "http_requests_total": [
+      {
+        "type": "counter",
+        "help": "Number of HTTP requests",
+        "unit": ""
+      }
+    ]
+  }
+}
+```
